.TH LIBMPQ__ARCHIVE_CREATE 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__archive_create \- create a seekable MPQ archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.PP
.B int32_t libmpq__archive_create(mpq_archive_s **archive, const char *path, const mpq_archive_create_options_s *options);
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a v1 or v2 archive at \fIpath\fP. The archive is finalized by
libmpq__archive_close(3). The options select a fixed entry capacity, sector
size, archive version, and optional generated (listfile).
